@startuml
title Immigration Helper - Data Flow Diagram

' External Entities
rectangle "User" as user #LightBlue

' Processes
rectangle "1.0\nReact\nFrontend" as frontend #LightGreen
rectangle "2.0\nNode.js\nAPI Server" as nodeapi #LightGreen
rectangle "3.0\nRAG\nService" as rag #LightGreen
rectangle "4.0\nVector\nSearch" as vector #LightGreen
rectangle "5.0\nLLM\nProcessing" as llm #LightGreen

' External Systems
rectangle "NewsData.io\nAPI" as newsapi #LightBlue

' Data Stores
database "D1\nVisa Documents\n(Markdown)" as docs
database "D2\nVector Database\n(ChromaDB)" as vectordb
database "D3\nFAISS Index" as faiss

' User to Frontend
user --> frontend : User Query\n(Text Input)
user --> frontend : Page Navigation
user --> frontend : Language Selection

frontend --> user : Display Results
frontend --> user : News Articles
frontend --> user : AI Response

' Frontend to Node API
frontend --> nodeapi : API Request\n(Chat Query)
frontend --> nodeapi : Fetch News Request
nodeapi --> frontend : JSON Response
nodeapi --> frontend : News Data

' Node API to Services
nodeapi --> newsapi : HTTP Request\n(Immigration News)
newsapi --> nodeapi : News Articles\n(JSON)

nodeapi --> rag : Chat Query\n(User Question)
rag --> nodeapi : AI Answer +\nSource Documents

' RAG Service Flow
rag --> docs : Load Document\nContent
docs --> rag : Raw Text

rag --> vector : Similarity Search\n(User Query)
vector --> vectordb : Query Embeddings
vectordb --> vector : Similar Docs
vector --> rag : Retrieved Context

rag --> llm : Generate Answer\n(Context + Query)
llm --> rag : AI Response

' Document Processing (Offline)
docs -.-> vector : Document Ingestion\n(Preprocessing)
vector -.-> vectordb : Store Embeddings
vector -.-> faiss : Build Index

note right of docs
  Static markdown files
  - Country guides
  - Visa types
  - Passport info
end note

note right of vectordb
  Persistent storage
  - Document chunks
  - Metadata
  - Embeddings
end note

note bottom of llm
  Ollama (Mistral 7B)
  Local inference
  GPU accelerated
end note

@enduml
